      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. when you mention the \"establishment of Israel\" and the \"displacement of Palestinians,\" how do historians usually frame the legitimacy of those two events? like, is there a consensus on which side has the primary historical right to the land, or is it strictly viewed as two competing claims?",
